  "implemented": [
    "One pre-layout winning-edge plan resolves six table border origins before intrinsic sizing, final content/percentage dimensions and paint; collapsed insets use half winning edges.",
    "Collapsed padding, column hints, spanning interiors, centered multi-stroke rules and repeated-group source ownership share the table owner.",
    "Fragment starts retain the complete incoming horizontal rule; safe fragment ends retain its upper half, matching the inspected native edge.",
    "Replaced internal-display elements use the canonical used-display/anonymous-table owner and retain their own border paint.",
    "PDF-capable MHTML image requests retain embedded CSS/CID resources with package permission independent from bounded host/file permissions."
  ],
